{"id":"9a856779455ef3e1","group":"72","path":"72/72-cor-structured-hierarchy-eventual-domination.md","title":"结构化层次的最终支配","display":"cor-structured-hierarchy-eventual-domination — 结构化层次的最终支配","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-cor-structured-hierarchy-eventual-domination","aliases":["72-cor-structured-hierarchy-eventual-domination"],"display":"cor-structured-hierarchy-eventual-domination — 结构化层次的最终支配","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]","[[72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Cor.2.22; print160; PDF172","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_status":"checked","source_proof_status":"checked","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-cor-structured-hierarchy-eventual-domination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-cor-structured-hierarchy-eventual-domination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-structured-hierarchy-eventual-domination — 结构化层次的最终支配"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2a9f766f12bca93\" href=\"?note=c2a9f766f12bca93\" title=\"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion\">72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8d01f06a62827a91\" href=\"?note=8d01f06a62827a91\" title=\"72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity\">72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Cor.2.22; print160; PDF172"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_s,\\Omega,\\prec,\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\Omega_s,\\Omega,\\prec,\\alpha[n]\\)</span> 及前驱穷尽见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c2a9f766f12bca93\" href=\"?note=c2a9f766f12bca93\" title=\"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion\">72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H,B,F\">\\(G,H,B,F\\)</span> 及前驱严格比较见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8d01f06a62827a91\" href=\"?note=8d01f06a62827a91\" title=\"72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity\">72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\beta\\in\\Omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\prec\\alpha\">\\(\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists N\\in\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\left(n\\ge N\\ \\longrightarrow\\ G_\\beta(n)&lt;G_\\alpha(n)\\land H_\\beta(n)&lt;H_\\alpha(n)\\land B_\\beta(n)&lt;B_\\alpha(n)\\land F_\\beta(n)&lt;F_\\alpha(n)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists N\\in\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\left(n\\ge N\\ \\longrightarrow\\ G_\\beta(n)&lt;G_\\alpha(n)\\land H_\\beta(n)&lt;H_\\alpha(n)\\land B_\\beta(n)&lt;B_\\alpha(n)\\land F_\\beta(n)&lt;F_\\alpha(n)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Corollary 2.22 及其证明，印刷 p.160 / PDF p.172。陈述与证明已核对；这不是把外延序数大小直接转成所有输入上的点态支配。</p>\n<p>证明：由穷尽定理取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\alpha[m]\">\\(\\beta\\in\\alpha[m]\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\max(m,1)\">\\(N=\\max(m,1)\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge N\">\\(n\\ge N\\)</span>，前驱集递增给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>。单调性定理的四个前驱比较于是同时适用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion","status":"resolved","id":"c2a9f766f12bca93","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"8d01f06a62827a91","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion","status":"resolved","id":"c2a9f766f12bca93","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega_s,\\Omega,\\prec,\\alpha[n]$ 及前驱穷尽见 [[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]；$G,H,B,F$ 及前驱严格比较见 [[72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"8d01f06a62827a91","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega_s,\\Omega,\\prec,\\alpha[n]$ 及前驱穷尽见 [[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]；$G,H,B,F$ 及前驱严格比较见 [[72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega_s,\\Omega,\\prec,\\alpha[n]","display":false},{"tex":"G,H,B,F","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\prec\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists N\\in\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\left(n\\ge N\\ \\longrightarrow\\ G_\\beta(n)<G_\\alpha(n)\\land H_\\beta(n)<H_\\alpha(n)\\land B_\\beta(n)<B_\\alpha(n)\\land F_\\beta(n)<F_\\alpha(n)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\alpha[m]","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\max(m,1)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge N","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]","display":false},{"tex":"n>0","display":false}],"bytes":1675,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-264","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-cor-structured-hierarchy-eventual-domination|cor-structured-hierarchy-eventual-domination — 结构化层次的最终支配]]"}],"outgoing":["c2a9f766f12bca93","8d01f06a62827a91"]}